026/blob/0e7c9feee4a6d09a3db1fde3ae339cee1f985a24/json/CVE-2008-2238.nvd","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2008-2238","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-2238.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3vwc-vg65-rpwm/GHSA-3vwc-vg65-rpwm.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-2140.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2008/FreeBSD-2008-0150.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0038","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-2237","title":"OpenOffice.org WMF文件处理堆缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org 2.x（2.4.2之前的版本）在解析WMF（Windows Metafile）格式图像文件时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可构造包含恶意数据的WMF文件，当用户使用OpenOffice打开该文档时，由于程序未对WMF文件中的图像尺寸参数进行充分验证，导致堆内存被越界写入，进而可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响Windows、Linux等多个平台上的OpenOffice.org 2.x早期版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害等级为高危（CVSS 9.3）。用户需升级至OpenOffice.org 2.4.2或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2008-2237"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-10-30T20:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:53:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenOffice.org 到 2.4.2 或更高版本。Linux 用户可通过包管理器执行：Debian/Ubuntu 使用 sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install openoffice.org，Red Hat/CentOS 使用 sudo yum update openoffice.org。Windows 用户需从 Apache OpenOffice 官网（https://openoffice.org）下载 2.4.2+ 版本并覆盖安装。若暂时无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的 WMF 格式文件，可在文件管理器中右键查看文件扩展名进行识别。长期方案建议迁移至 LibreOffice（OpenOffice 的活跃分支），其最新版本已彻底修复此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2008-11/msg00002.html"